ta.lastUpdated = 2023-11-13T10:15:00Z, meta.source = \"BP\". No OperationOutcome received.\n4) Post-POST verification (GET repeated as in step 1):\n   - Result: empty (no records found)\n\nTechnical details available\n- HTTP status codes: Not surfaced by the FHIR function\n- Response headers: Not surfaced\n- Request/correlation IDs: Not surfaced\n- Server payload excerpts (examples):\n  \u2022 Response (Systolic):\n    {\n      \"resourceType\":\"Observation\",\n      \"id\": null,\n      \"meta\":{\"versionId\": null,\"lastUpdated\":\"2023-11-13T10:15:00Z\",\"source\":\"BP\"},\n      \"status\":\"final\",\n      \"category\":[{\"coding\":[{\"system\":\"http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-category\",\"code\":\"vital-signs\",\"display\":\"Vital Signs\"}]}],\n      \"code\":{\"coding\":[{\"system\":\"http://loinc.org\",\"code\":\"8480-6\",\"display\":\"Systolic blood pressure\"}],\"text\":\"BP Systolic (flowsheet: BP)\"},\n      \"subject\":{\"reference\":\"Patient/S2119664\"},\n      \"effectiveDateTime\":\"2023-11-13T10:15:00Z\",\n      \"issued\":\"2023-11-13T10:15:00Z\",\n      \"valueQuantity\":{\"value\":118,\"unit\":\"mmHg\",\"system\":\"http://unitsofmeasure.org\",\"code\":\"mm[Hg]\"}\n    }\n  \u2022 Response (Diastolic) is analogous with code 8462-4 and value 77.\n\nExpected vs actual\n- Expected: POST returns HTTP 201 with a persisted resource (non-null id), and subsequent GET finds both Observations.\n- Actual: POST returns Observation with id = null; subsequent GETs return none.\n\nRequests for IT\n- Confirm whether Observation POSTs are being accepted/persisted.\n- Verify if BP must be recorded as a panel (LOINC 85354-9 with components) vs separate Observations for our endpoint.\n- Confirm support/requirements for Observation.issued and meta.source, and whether the \u201cBP\u201d flowsheet mapping is correct.\n- Check for permission or write-path issues for Patient/S2119664 or this timestamp.\n\nPlan after resolution\n- We will re-attempt posting two separat